{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOB","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"約伯記","commonName":"約伯記","title":"約伯記","order":18,"numberOfChapters":42,"sha256":"3aa72174529879f59c9c24a590c7f512dafc69fc78e843aed0f93864112147ea","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":42,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOB/42.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1068},"chapter":{"number":42,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["約伯回答耶和華說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"「我知道你無所不能，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的旨意無不成就。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你問，『是誰用無知蒙蔽我的旨意？』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誠然，我對所談的事一無所知，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這些事太奇妙，我無法明白。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你說，『你且聽著，我要發言。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我來提問，你來回答。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我從前風聞有你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在親眼看見你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此我厭惡自己，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在塵土和爐灰中懺悔。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["結語"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["耶和華對約伯說完這些話後，就對提幔人以利法說：「你和你的兩個朋友讓我憤怒，因為你們對我的議論不如我僕人約伯說的有理。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["現在你們要取七頭公牛和七隻公羊，到我僕人約伯那裡，為自己獻上燔祭，因為你們對我的議論不如我僕人約伯說的有理。我僕人約伯會為你們禱告，我會悅納他的禱告，不按你們的愚妄懲罰你們。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["於是，提幔人以利法、書亞人比勒達和拿瑪人瑣法遵命而行，耶和華悅納了約伯的禱告。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["約伯為朋友們禱告後，耶和華恢復了他以前的昌盛，並且耶和華賜給他的比以前多一倍。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["約伯的兄弟姊妹和從前的朋友都來探望他，在他家裡一同吃飯，為他遭受耶和華所降的種種災難而安撫、慰問他。他們每人送他一塊銀子和一個金環。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["耶和華賜給約伯晚年的福分比起初更多：他有一萬四千隻羊、六千隻駱駝、一千對牛和一千頭母驢。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他還有七個兒子和三個女兒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["他給長女取名叫耶米瑪、次女叫基洗亞、三女叫基連·哈樸。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["地上找不到像約伯三個女兒那樣美麗的女子。約伯讓她們與弟兄一同承受產業。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["此後，約伯又活了一百四十年，得見四代子孫。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["約伯年紀老邁，壽終正寢。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOB/42.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOB/41.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}